  "buildAdaptations": [
    "Use Skia bundled raw_ptr fallback (partition_alloc is absent from the locked standalone DEPS).",
    "Set the explicit local emsdk path; this source supplier leaves it unset.",
    "Disable global emsdk activation; all compiler setup stays inside the build root.",
    "Limit Ninja concurrency without removing rendering/font/codec features.",
    "Add CanvasKit to the supplier standalone modules target only for is_canvaskit builds.",
    "Keep the supplier 128 MiB initial linear memory and bound each instance to 256 MiB maximum; App queries have an explicit host-owned reservation separate from Content and Render.",
